<title>USA: Vencor completes Transitional offer.</title>
<headline>Vencor completes Transitional offer.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vencor Inc said Friday it has completed a cash tender offer for 37,247,234, or about 95.5 percent, of Transitional Hospitals Corp's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The tender offer, which expired Thursday, was at a price of $16 a share in cash.</p>
<p>The company said it will acquire the remaining shares for $16 a share in cash.</p>
<p>Vencor said the company that comes from the merger will have pro forma revenues of about $3.3 billion.</p>
</text>
